[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=FrigatePiP
Comment=Camera windows for Frigate NVR detections
Comment[pl]=Okna kamer przy wykryciach Frigate NVR
Comment[de]=Kamerafenster bei Erkennungen von Frigate NVR
Comment[es]=Ventanas de cámaras para las detecciones de Frigate NVR
Comment[pt]=Janelas das câmaras para as deteções do Frigate NVR
Comment[fr]=Fenêtres des caméras pour les détections de Frigate NVR
Exec=frigate-pip --output window
Icon=frigate-pip
Terminal=false
Categories=AudioVideo;Video;
Keywords=Frigate;camera;NVR;
StartupNotify=false
